  "description": "Think of this recipe as a mash-up of carrot cake jam and orange marmalade. Try it on carrot or zucchini bread, whole wheat toast, or as a topping for crostini with ricotta. If you can't find Pomona's Pectin, use regular no- or low-sugar powdered pectin.",
